    "preamble": "Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation vs Chandarbhai Dineshbhai Maheshwari on 23 April, 2018 Author: G.R.Udhwani Bench: G.R.Udhwani R/Cr.A/1631/2012 Judgment In The High Court Of Gujarat At Ahmedabad R/Criminal Appeal No. 1631 of 2012 For Approval And Signature: Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Udhwani Sd/- ========================================================== 1 Whether Reporters of Local Papers may be allowed to No see the judgment ? 2 To be referred to the Reporter or not ? No 3 Whether their Lordships wish to see the fair copy of the NO judgment ? 4 Whether this case involves a substantial question of law NO as to the interpretation of the Constitution of India or any order made thereunder ? ========================================================== AHMEDABAD MUNICIPAL CORPORATION Versus CHANDARBHAI DINESHBHAI MAHESHWARI ========================================================== Appearance: MS JIRGA D JHAVERI(3471) for the PETITIONER(s) No. 1 MR MANISH R RAVAL(1250) for the RESPONDENT(s) No. 1 MR L R PUJARI APP(2) for the RESPONDENT(s) No. 2 ========================================================== CORAM: HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE G.R.UDHWANI Date : 23/04/2018 Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation vs Chandarbhai Dineshbhai Maheshwari on 23 April, 2018 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/144996323/ 1 ORAL JUDGMENT Judgment and order dated 17/09/2011 recording acquittal for the respondent No.1 for the offence punishable under Section 7 read with Section 16 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 by R/CR.A/1631/2012 JUDGMENT the learned Metropolitan Magistrate, Court N o . 6 , A h m e d a b a d i n C r i m i n a l C a s e N o .",
